{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"佛說佛母寶德藏般若波羅蜜經卷上","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[一]宋西天譯經三藏明教大師法賢奉詔譯","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"行品第一","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"爾時世尊爲令四衆各得歡喜說是般若波羅蜜經使獲利樂.卽說伽陀曰.","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"所有菩薩爲世間　滅除蓋障煩惱垢　發淨信心住寂靜　當行智度彼岸行.","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"諸江河流閻浮提　華果藥草皆得潤　龍王主住無熱池　彼龍威力流江河.","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"亦如佛子聲聞等　說法教他方使說　樂最聖行求果報　此諸如來勝威德。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"雲何佛說此法[二]眼　令諸弟子如佛學　自證教他及方便　此亦佛力非自力。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"最上般若不可[三]知　非心可知非菩提　如是聞已不驚怖　彼菩薩行知佛智。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"色受想行識皆無　不著纖塵無[四]處所　彼若不住一切法　行無[五]受想得菩提.","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"菩薩若求出家智　照見五藴無實相　知此[六]不求於寂靜　彼是菩薩之行智.","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"復此雲何智所得　照見一切法皆空　不著不驚照見時　自覺覺他諸菩薩.","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[一]原刻譯號首無宋字．藏下有朝散大夫試光祿卿八字．師下有臣字．今悉改正．次二卷同．","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[二]據藏本眼當作相．","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[三]知當作得．","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[四]處所當作所住．","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[五]受想當作攝受．","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[六]不求於寂靜當作不觸證涅槃．次後同．","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"色受想行及識藴　是藴見行而不知　菩薩照見藴皆空　行無相化不著句.","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"無色受想行識等　不行是名無相行　若行不得最[一]上智　無相寂靜三摩地。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"若菩薩行自寂靜　過去諸佛鹹授記　身苦樂等皆不及　由知[二]因果法本性．","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"若行於法不可得　行如是行乃佛智　行無所行了知已　是行最上般若行．","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"彼無所行不可得　愚癡著相謂有無　有無二法皆非實　出此了知乃菩薩。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"菩薩若知諸幻化　色受想行識亦然　寂靜行離種種[三]相　此名最上般若行．","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"善友方便令知覺　使聞佛母不驚怖　惡友同行及化他　坏器盛水非堅牢。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"雲何得名爲菩薩　一切樂行皆無著　求佛菩提無所著　是故得名爲菩薩．","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"雲何得名摩訶薩　得第一義衆生中　斷衆生界諸邪見　是故得名摩訶薩．","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"大施大慧大威德　佛乘最上而得乘　發菩提心度衆生　是故得名摩訶薩．","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"幻化四[四]足俱胝數　多人衆前悉截首　一切世界皆幻化　菩薩知已得無怖．","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"色受想行識纏縛　知不實已不求解　行菩提心無所[五]著　此名最上諸菩薩。","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[一]據藏本上當作堅．","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[二]因果衍文．","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[三]相當作想．次後同．","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[四]據藏本足當作衢．","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[五]著當作懼．","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"雲何得名爲菩[一]薩　乘大乘行度衆生　大乘體相如虛空　菩薩由得安隱樂．","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"大乘之乘不可得　乘涅槃往諸方所　行已不見如火滅　是故名爲入涅槃．","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"菩薩所行不可得　初後現在三清淨　清淨無[二]畏無戲論　是行最上般若行。","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"大智菩薩行行時　發大慈悲爲衆生　爲已不起衆生相　是行最上般若行．","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"菩薩起念爲衆生　修諸[三]苦行有苦相　是有我相衆生相　此非最上般若行．","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"知自及諸衆生等　乃至諸法亦復然　生滅無二無分別　是行最上般若行．","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"乃至所說世界等　名離一切生滅法　最上無比甘露智　是故得名爲般若．","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"菩薩如是所行行　了知方便無所求　知此法本性非實　是行最上般若[四]行。","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"若不住色亦無受　亦不住想亦無行　復不住識住正法　是名最上般若行．","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[五]帝釋品第二","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"歡喜地攝布施波羅蜜伽陀。","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[六]常與無常苦樂等　我及無我悉皆空　不住有爲及無爲　住無相行佛亦然．","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[一]薩下當有大乘二字．","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[二]畏當作爲．","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[三]原刻作若．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[四]藏本初分竟．下頌當入次品．","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[五]藏本無品名．又缺釋文．次後各品均同．","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[六]藏本兩頌今略爲一．","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"若求聲聞緣覺等　乃至佛果亦復然　不住此忍不可得　如渡大河不見岸。","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"若聞此法彼定得　成等正覺證涅槃　見於一切如[一]自身　是大智者如來說．","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[二]佛子當住四補特伽羅是行大智行一真實善法二不退心三應供離垢無煩惱無求","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"四善友同等。","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"大智菩薩如是行　不學聲聞及緣覺　樂學如來一切智　是學非學名爲學．","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"學不受色不增減　亦復不學種種法　攝受樂學一切智　若此功德出離者．","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"色非有智非無智　受想行識亦復爾　色性自性如虛空　平等無二無分別。","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"妄想本性無[三]彼岸　衆生之界亦復然　虛空自性亦同然　智慧世間解亦爾．","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"智慧無色佛所說　離一切想到彼岸　若人得離諸想已　是人語意住真如．","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"彼人住世恆沙劫　不聞佛說衆生聲　衆生不生本清淨　是行最上般若行。","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"佛說種[四]種之語言　皆具最上般若義　過去佛爲我授記　於未來世證菩提．","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"持無量功德建塔品第三","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[一]據藏本自身當作幻化．","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[二]此段原係頌文．今譯改式．","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[三]彼岸當作邊際．","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[四]此頌當入次品．","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"無垢地攝持戒波羅蜜伽陀。","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"若人常受持般若　所作上應諸佛行　刀劍毒藥水火等　乃至諸魔不能爲。","sortOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"若人於佛滅度後　建七寶塔以供養　如是圓滿千俱胝　佛刹恆沙等佛塔．","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"衆生無邊千俱胝　以妙香華塗香等　供養三世無邊劫　所有功德之數量．","sortOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"不及書寫於佛母　諸佛由此而得生　若受持讀誦供養　功德倍勝於佛塔。","sortOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"大明般若諸佛母　能[一]持苦惱徧世界　所有三世十方佛　學此明得無上師．","sortOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"行般若行利有情　使學[二]大智證菩提　有爲無爲諸快樂　一切樂從般若生。","sortOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"譬如大地植諸種　得和合生種種色　五波羅蜜及菩提　皆從般若所生出．","sortOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"又如輪王出行時　七寶四兵爲導從　若依佛母最上行　一切功德法集聚。","sortOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"功德品第四","sortOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"發光地攝忍辱波羅蜜伽陀。","sortOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"帝釋有疑問佛曰　恆河沙數等佛刹　佛[三]界圓滿如芥子　能受佛刹般若力．","sortOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[一]據藏本持當作滅．","sortOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[二]大智當作善巧．次後均同．","sortOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[三]此謂舍利．","sortOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"如是了知般若已　此界雲何不供養　譬如人王人所重　[一]住般若者合亦爾．","sortOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"佛界般若摩尼寶　具一切德價無比　經函安處經有無　供養悉獲寶功德．","sortOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"佛滅供養於舍利　不及供養於般若　若樂受持供養者　是人速得證解脫．","sortOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"首行布施波羅蜜　次戒忍進及禪定　受持善法不可壞　彼一一生一切法．","sortOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"如閻浮提種種樹　百千俱胝無數色　雖一一樹影皆別　無量影同一名攝．","sortOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"五波羅蜜五名異　般若波羅復一名　一切迴施爲菩提　一味同歸菩提名。","sortOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"福量品第五","sortOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"燄慧地攝精進波羅蜜伽陀。","sortOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"彼色受想行識等　菩薩觀照悉無常　各各現行而不知　非法非生智者見．","sortOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"無色無受想行識　是法無得復無生　了知一切法皆空　是名最上般若行。","sortOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"如化恆沙等佛刹　諸衆生證羅漢果　若能書寫此般若　令他受持功德勝．","sortOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"如佛修行雲何學　信重般若諸法空　速證聲聞及緣覺　乃至無上正覺尊．","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[一]據藏本住當作依．","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[一]世間無種不生樹　枝葉華果悉無有　無佛誰指菩提心　亦無釋梵聲聞果．","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"如日舒光照諸天　普使成就種種業　佛智菩提心亦然　從智生諸功德法．","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"如無熱池無龍主　卽無河流閻浮提　無河華果悉不生　亦無大海種種寶．","sortOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"世間無佛無大智　無智功德不增長　亦無佛法諸莊嚴　無菩提海等等寶．","sortOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"譬如世間螢有光　一切螢光集一處　比日一光照世間　微塵數分不及一。","sortOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"隨喜功德品第六","sortOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"難勝地攝定波羅蜜伽陀。","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"所有聲聞衆功德布施持戒觀照行　不及菩薩發一心隨喜福藴之少分．","sortOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"所有俱胝那由他無邊佛刹千俱胝　過去現在佛說此法寶爲斷一切苦．","sortOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"先發最上菩提心至成正覺及入滅　彼量所有佛功德鹹成方便波羅蜜．","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"及彼聲聞學無學有漏無漏諸善法　菩薩等一普[二]迴施當爲世間證菩提．","sortOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"菩薩施已不住心住心卽名衆生相　有見有念名著相非是菩薩之迴施。","sortOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[一]以下經文未詳","sortOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[二]據藏本迴施當作迴向．次後均同．又單言施亦同．","sortOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"如是施非無相施是法當知有滅盡　若作非法非施心乃可得名爲迴施.","sortOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"作有相施非真施無相迴施證菩提　如上妙食雜毒藥[一]自法著相亦如是.","sortOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"是故迴施應當學如佛衆善悉當知　若生若相若威力悉皆隨喜而迴施.","sortOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"以功德施佛菩提菩薩之施皆無[二]相　此施佛許而印可如是得名勇猛施。","sortOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"地獄品第七","sortOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"現前地攝智慧波羅蜜伽陀。","sortOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"無量盲人不見道無一得入於城郭　修六度行闕般若無[三]力不能成菩提.","sortOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"譬如畫像不畫眼因無眼界無功德　若有受行於智慧得名有眼及有力。","sortOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"有爲無爲黑白法如微塵[四]等不可得　智慧觀照如虛空故名般若[五]出世間．","sortOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"菩薩諦信行佛行度那由他苦衆生　如是若著衆生相此非般若最上行。","sortOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"菩薩若行最上行過去未曾求大智　今聞般若如佛想速證寂靜佛菩提．","sortOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"過去信佛那由他不信般若波羅蜜　或生瞋恨或誹謗是人少智墮阿鼻．","sortOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[一]自當作白．","sortOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[二]相當作毒．","sortOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[三]據藏本力當作眼．","sortOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[四]等當作許．","sortOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[五]出當作引．","sortOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"若人樂證諸佛智不能信重諸佛母　如商入海欲求寶返失於本而復還。","sortOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"清淨品第八〈此品攝第九歎品〉","sortOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"遠行地攝方便波羅蜜伽陀。","sortOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[一]色清淨故果清淨果色二同一切智　若一切智清淨時如虛空界不斷[二]壞。","sortOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"菩薩出過於三界斷盡煩惱而現生無老病死現滅度斯卽是行般若行．","sortOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"世間[三]欲色之淤泥　愚人處中如風[四]旋　亦如鹿在[五]屋中轉智者如禽飛虛空．","sortOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"若不著色無受想亦無行識乃清淨　如是離諸煩惱垢解脫名佛大智行．","sortOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"菩薩如是行大智得離諸[六]相脫輪迴　如日解脫羅睺障光明普徧照世間．","sortOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"火燒草木及樹林如一切法性清淨　作如是觀亦非觀如是最上般若[七]行。","sortOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_154","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"稱讚功德品第十","sortOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"不動地攝願波羅蜜．善慧地攝力波羅蜜伽陀。","sortOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_156","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"帝釋天主問佛言雲何菩薩行智慧　佛答微塵數藴界無此藴界之菩薩．","sortOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[一]此頌當屬前品．","sortOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[二]藏本次分竟．","sortOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[三]據藏本欲當作名．","sortOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[四]旋當作輪．","sortOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_162","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[五]屋當作途．","sortOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[六]相當作著．","sortOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_164","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[七]藏本第三分竟．","sortOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_166","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"菩薩久行應可知於俱胝佛作勝緣　新學聞此生邪疑或不樂求而不學。","sortOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_167","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"又如人行深惡道忽見邊界牧牛人　心得安隱無賊怖知去城郭而非遙．","sortOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_168","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"若聞最上般若已復得樂求佛菩提　如獲安隱得無怖心超羅漢緣覺地．","sortOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_169","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"譬如人往觀大海先見大山大樹林　見此所愛祥瑞境必達大海知非遠．","sortOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"菩薩若發最上心聞此般若波羅蜜　雖未授記於佛前此證菩提亦非遠．","sortOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_171","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"如見春生諸草木知有華實而非遙　若人手得此般若得證菩提亦非遠．","sortOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"亦如女人懷其妊十月滿足必誕生　菩薩若聞寶德藏速成正覺之祥瑞。","sortOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"若行般若波羅蜜見色非增亦非減　見法非法如法界不求寂靜卽般若．","sortOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"行者若不[一]思佛法不思力足及寂靜　離思非思無相行是行最上般若行。","sortOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"魔品第十一","sortOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_176","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"法雲地攝智慧彼岸伽陀。","sortOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[二]佛告善現汝諦聽凡夫聲聞緣覺地　斯卽名爲如來地一切如一彼無疑．","sortOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_179","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[一]據藏本思當作分別．","sortOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_180","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[二]次下二頌半藏本缺．經文亦不詳．","sortOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_182","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"所有稱讚離言說從彼徧照如來時　乃至成所之作智住持大金剛佛地.","sortOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_183","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"觀察無相住虛空應知不斷佛種故。","sortOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_184","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"善現白佛言世尊雲何菩薩之魔事　佛言菩薩魔事多我今爲汝略宣說．","sortOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_185","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"有無數魔種種變當書最上般若時　速離天宮如電滅來於世間作魔事．","sortOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_186","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"或有示現樂欲說或不聽受返瞋恨　不說名姓及氏族如是魔事鹹應知．","sortOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_187","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"愚癡無智無方便無根寧有枝葉等　聞般若已別求經如[一]棄全象返求足．","sortOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_188","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"如人先得百味食或[二]得稻飯爲上味　菩薩先得般若已棄拾樂求羅漢果．","sortOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_189","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"或爲樂求於利養心著族姓留種跡　捨彼正法行非法是魔引入於邪道．","sortOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_190","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"若人聞此最上法當於法師深信重　法師知魔不應著身適悅及不適悅．","sortOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_191","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"復有無數種種魔嬈亂無數苾芻衆　欲求持誦此般若不能獲得無價寶．","sortOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_192","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[三]佛母般若實難得　初心菩薩欲樂求　若十方佛而攝受　一切惡魔不能爲。","sortOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_193","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"佛說佛母寶德藏般[四]若波羅蜜經卷上","sortOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_195","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[一]據藏本棄當作得．","sortOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_196","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[二]得當作求．","sortOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_197","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[三]藏本兩頌．今略爲一．","sortOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_225_198","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_225","text":"[四]原刻尾題波羅蜜經作伽陀．今改正．次二卷同．","sortOrder":198}],"overrides":{}}